+## Incremental native validation
+
+`V4SessionStreamValidator` applies the same native lifecycle and ownership checks used by full V4 restoration to an append-only sequence. Its checkpoint retains surface coordinates and unresolved lifecycle metadata, with source-owned lookup for earlier header/title references. `finish()` validates the observed prefix without requiring open native turns or steps to end. Fork inheritance, delivery/catalog exemptions and orphan compaction markers retain their released behavior. Checkpoints are derived reader metadata and do not alter the committed Session format.
